# `Weak(T)` (plans/backlog/WEAK_AND_UNCOLLECTED_RC.md §7 W3): the cell a Weak
# keeps after its last `Rc` is freed by the last `Weak`, and a cycle closed
# through a `Weak` is freed by reference counting, under `auto` and `off`
# alike, so the `--debug-heap` report counts no block live at exit either way.
# stdout keeps only the probe line and the report's live-at-exit count.
stdout_keep_match=(weak: [a-z ]+ (true|false)|live at exit: [0-9]+ blocks)
timeout=600
